text = "In this minigame, you will be a flight surgeon comparing pre-spaceflight and post-spaceflight reports for an astronaut who had a week-long spaceflight. You also have your own notes about what normal deviations for health levels are. Compare the reports and determine if any of the levels are abnormal."

